flowchart TD
    Start([Platform Admin or Prospective Gym Owner]) --> Step1[Submit Gym Onboarding Request]
    
    Step1 --> InputDetails[Provide Gym Name, Slug, Contact Email, Phone & Address]
    InputDetails --> SelectPlan[Select SaaS Subscription Plan: Starter, Pro, Enterprise]
    
    SelectPlan --> ValidateSlug{Is Gym Slug Unique?}
    ValidateSlug -->|No| SlugError[Error: Gym Slug / Subdomain Already In Use]
    SlugError --> InputDetails
    
    ValidateSlug -->|Yes| CreateGymRecord[Create Gym Tenant Record: saas_status = TRIAL]
    CreateGymRecord --> CreateDefaultBranch[Create Primary Default Gym Branch]
    
    CreateDefaultBranch --> CreateOwnerUser[Create Initial Gym Owner User Account]
    CreateOwnerUser --> AssignOwnerRole[Assign ROLE_GYM_OWNER with gym_id]
    
    AssignOwnerRole --> GenWelcomeEmail[Generate Activation Token & Welcome Email]
    GenWelcomeEmail --> OwnerLogin[Gym Owner Sets Password & Logs In]
    
    OwnerLogin --> SetupWizard[Gym Owner Completes Setup Wizard]
    SetupWizard --> ConfigBranding[Configure Gym Brand, Operating Hours & Logo]
    ConfigBranding --> CreateMemPlans[Define Membership Plans & Pricing Tiers]
    CreateMemPlans --> OnboardStaff[Invite / Onboard First Trainers]
    
    OnboardStaff --> LaunchReady([Gym Tenant Fully Operational & Live])
